+| ------------------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------- |
+| ProviderType                   | `packages/pms-domain/src/entities.ts#ProviderType`                                | `provider_types`                                       | `ProviderManagementService`                               | none; read-only Console surface                | `updatedAt` exists on stored values                                  |
+| PublicProviderPackage          | `packages/pms-application/src/provider-package-query.ts#PublicProviderPackage`    | workspace Provider Package registry                    | `ProviderPackageQueryService`                             | read-only                                      | none                                                                 |
+| Provider                       | `packages/pms-domain/src/entities.ts#Provider`                                    | `providers`                                            | `ProviderManagementService`                               | create, existing status transition             | `expectedUpdatedAt`                                                  |
+| Resource                       | `packages/pms-domain/src/entities.ts#Resource`                                    | `resources`                                            | `ProviderManagementService`                               | create, existing status transition             | `expectedUpdatedAt`                                                  |
+| ProviderResourceBinding        | `packages/pms-domain/src/bindings.ts#ProviderResourceBinding`                     | Provider-resource binding repository                   | `ProviderManagementService`                               | bind, unbind                                   | repository conflict semantics                                        |
+| ConfigurationDraft             | `packages/configuration-center/src/model.ts#ConfigurationDraft`                   | Configuration Center draft state                       | `ConfigurationCenter`                                     | create, update, validate                       | `expectedVersion`                                                    |
+| EffectiveConfigurationPreview  | `packages/configuration-center/src/model.ts#EffectiveConfigurationPreview`        | derived from definitions and drafts                    | `ConfigurationCenter.effectivePreview`                    | read-only                                      | draft version indirectly                                             |
+| ConfigurationPublicationResult | `packages/configuration-center/src/publication.ts#ConfigurationPublicationResult` | published configuration revisions                      | `ConfigurationPublicationService`                         | publish, rollback                              | `expectedDraftVersion` + `expectedPublishedRevision`                 |
+| ConfigRevision                 | `packages/pms-domain/src/entities.ts#ConfigRevision`                              | configuration revision repository                      | `ConfigurationPublicationService`                         | created by publish/rollback only               | repository revision CAS                                              |
+| RuntimeDeploymentView          | `apps/pms-api/src/runtime-deployment-routes.ts#RuntimeDeploymentView`             | RuntimeDeployment persistence                          | `RuntimeDeploymentApplicationService` and management port | create, start, stop, restart, scale, reconcile | `expectedDesiredRevision`; persistence also guards observed revision |
+| RuntimeProcessView             | `packages/pms-application/src/runtime-process-query.ts#RuntimeProcessView`        | Runtime process projection plus registration freshness | `RuntimeProcessQueryService`                              | read-only                                      | observed projection revision                                         |
+| RegistrySnapshot               | `packages/registry-snapshot/src/model.ts#RegistrySnapshot`                        | immutable Registry snapshots                           | `RegistrySnapshotRepository`                              | read-only in Console V1                        | revision/checksum                                                    |
+| RegistrySnapshotDiff           | `packages/registry-snapshot/src/model.ts#RegistrySnapshotDiff`                    | computed from immutable snapshots                      | `RegistrySnapshotRepository.diff`                         | read-only                                      | from/to revision                                                     |
+| AuditEvent projection          | `apps/pms-api/src/audit-routes.ts`                                                | Audit repository                                       | `AuditRepository.list`                                    | read-only                                      | cursor and occurred-before filter                                    |
+
+Database Profile management, Catalog management, Worker Job management, Runtime configuration ACK management, authentication, authorization, login, RBAC and user administration are deferred because no corresponding V1 Console business surface is being frozen.
